{
  "sheet": "hud",
  "doc": "League-style HUD, bottom centre. Coordinates in a 1920x1080 reference frame, scaled to the game's back buffer. source = league_assets id or computed. kinds: rect = framed panel; image = portrait or ability slot (cooldown sweep, key, rank pips, name); bar = xp or health (the Tarnished's Elden Ring HP); text = level badge; title = champion name; stats = attack damage / attack speed / ability power / range; castbar = Bountiful Harvest or Crowstorm progress, only while one runs; levelup = League's level-up button drawn above every ability slot that can take a skill point (x, y offset from the slot).",
